{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Hook</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hand-me-downs is a roguelike deck builder where you play against your own old hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your opponents don't have their own deck, so they borrow your cards!  <br>Each time you play a hand, your opponent takes the cards from your played hand and uses them against you the next time you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/ca767421cd984cea63611ce87347071e.poster.avif?t=1773268024\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/ca767421cd984cea63611ce87347071e.webm?t=1773268024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/ca767421cd984cea63611ce87347071e.mp4?t=1773268024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Entourage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each opponent brings a unique twist to the table, so be careful which cards you let them have.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Most opponents you encounter are too prideful to simply use the cards you hand down to them without applying their own touch first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether it's the <strong>The Painter</strong>\u00a0changing the suits, or<strong> The General</strong>\u00a0ranking the cards up, your opponents will make sure to complicate your plans, and provide deck-fixing opportunities to those skillful enough to manipulate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After all, <strong><i>their</i></strong> cards are<i> <strong>your</strong></i>\u00a0cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/dec141bc87fec3be89f7009c40fc7734.poster.avif?t=1773268024\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/dec141bc87fec3be89f7009c40fc7734.webm?t=1773268024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/dec141bc87fec3be89f7009c40fc7734.mp4?t=1773268024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each</strong> <strong>suit has its own flavor, and each rank its unique character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Throughout the game you'll get familiar with the\u00a0no-nonsense <i><strong>Clubs</strong></i>, the fortunate <i><strong>Coins</strong></i>, the\u00a0jolly <i><strong>Cups</strong></i>\u00a0and the ruthless <i><strong>Swords</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The sabotaging <strong><i>Jacks</i></strong>, clinical <strong><i>Knights</i></strong>, powerful <strong><i>Kings</i></strong> and wild <strong><i>Aces</i></strong>\u00a0are sure to provide many interesting interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/80fa6e53fcaa2e918c6a5d16ce55fd79.avif?t=1773268024\" width=1193 height=536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Sugar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Acquire powerful trinkets to manipulate your deck and score more points.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether by winning battles or spending gold at the shop, getting a hold of as many trinkets as you can will help you keep up with the increasing strength of your opponents as the rounds go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/cf1d03f984a5f9dd1b4e9bc870c21ee2.avif?t=1773268024\" width=909 height=271 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Spice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Redeem tickets at the shop to alter your cards and gain an edge over your opponents.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why do your opponents let you use these obviously illegal cards against them?  <br>Don't worry about it! <br>Holding the altered cards makes you feel funny? <br><strong>Do not worry about it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/ee6a658f8b70be4a2d67a214f18aade3.avif?t=1773268024\" width=997 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover and beat all decks on all tables.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each deck provides unique benefits and each table brings new challenges to the... table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Achieve victory with all combinations to earn the prestige<strong>\u00a0&quot;Hander of Downs&quot;</strong>\u00a0title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(Not a legally recognized title. Yet. Working on it.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/2f96314ad5226af4fa569a20a82fe75e.avif?t=1773268024\" width=1039 height=567 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Plea</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sit back, relax, bob your head to the beat, and let the shuffling begin!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/7882a8d55cf3702e6bd97a8f9cb12507.poster.avif?t=1773268024\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/7882a8d55cf3702e6bd97a8f9cb12507.webm?t=1773268024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/7882a8d55cf3702e6bd97a8f9cb12507.mp4?t=1773268024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870620?t=1773268024","b