strong></i>, the fortunate <i><strong>Coins</strong></i>, the\u00a0jolly <i><strong>Cups</strong></i>\u00a0and the ruthless <i><strong>Swords</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The sabotaging <strong><i>Jacks</i></strong>, clinical <strong><i>Knights</i></strong>, powerful <strong><i>Kings</i></strong> and wild <strong><i>Aces</i></strong>\u00a0are sure to provide many interesting interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/80fa6e53fcaa2e918c6a5d16ce55fd79.avif?t=1773268024\" width=1193 height=536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Sugar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Acquire powerful trinkets to manipulate your deck and score more points.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether by winning battles or spending gold at the shop, getting a hold of as many trinkets as you can will help you keep up with the increasing strength of your opponents as the rounds go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/cf1d03f984a5f9dd1b4e9bc870c21ee2.avif?t=1773268024\" width=909 height=271 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Spice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Redeem tickets at the shop to alter your cards and gain an edge over your opponents.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why do your opponents let you use these obvious